#: docs/index.md
msgid "folio-assistant"
msgstr "folio-assistant"

#: docs/index.md
msgid "A content-agnostic agent skills framework for authoring rigorous content with a large language model — scientific papers and books, WHO SMART Guidelines, and FHIR Implementation Guides — backed by an MCP server, role-based access control, and a typed content-object model."
msgstr "一个与内容无关的智能体技能框架，用于利用大语言模型创作严谨的内容——科学论文与专著、WHO SMART 指南以及 FHIR 实施指南——由 MCP 服务器、基于角色的访问控制（RBAC）和类型化内容对象模型提供支持。"

#: docs/index.md
msgid "Get started{: .btn .btn-primary .fs-5 .mb-4 .mb-md-0 .mr-2 } Install{: .btn .fs-5 .mb-4 .mb-md-0 .mr-2 } View on GitHub{: .btn .fs-5 .mb-4 .mb-md-0 }"
msgstr "开始使用{: .btn .btn-primary .fs-5 .mb-4 .mb-md-0 .mr-2 } 安装{: .btn .fs-5 .mb-4 .mb-md-0 .mr-2 } 在 GitHub 上查看{: .btn .fs-5 .mb-4 .mb-md-0 }"

#: docs/index.md
msgid "What is folio-assistant?"
msgstr "什么是 folio-assistant？"

#: docs/index.md
msgid "folio-assistant is the platform — it does not contain content. It provides the skills, schemas, tooling, and an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that an LLM-driven agent uses to plan, author, validate, review, test, and publish a folio of content that lives in a separate repository."
msgstr "folio-assistant 是平台——它本身不包含内容。它提供技能、模式、工具链以及一个 MCP（Model Context Protocol）服务器，供 LLM 驱动的智能体用于规划、撰写、验证、审阅、测试和发布存放在独立仓库中的内容作品集（folio）。"

#: docs/index.md
msgid "Separation of concerns. This documentation describes the *formalism of the"
msgstr "关注点分离。本篇文档阐述了*框架的形式化规范与"

#: docs/index.md
msgid "framework and how to use folio-assistant* — deliberately kept **separate from"
msgstr "如何使用 folio-assistant*——刻意**独立于"

#: docs/index.md
msgid "any specific content**. Where content appears in these pages, it is purely"
msgstr "任何具体内容**。当这些页面中出现具体内容时，它纯粹是"

#: docs/index.md
msgid "illustrative (an example), never the canonical artifact."
msgstr "说明性的（示例），绝非规范性制品。"

